<section class="known-site-section" id="architecture">
    <div class="known-site-section-head">
        <span>Architecture</span>
        <h2>围绕核心库、插件层和宿主层构建清晰结构</h2>
        <p>成熟框架官网需要把架构边界表达清楚。Known 的组织方式强调职责分离，让业务代码能稳定沉淀在插件层，而不是散落在宿主工程里。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="known-site-grid known-site-grid-2">
        <article class="known-site-card known-site-card-accent">
            <h3>核心层与插件层</h3>
            <ul class="known-site-list">
                <li><strong>Known</strong>：对象模型、数据访问、组件基类、权限、工作流等核心能力。</li>
                <li><strong>Plugins/</strong>：系统增强插件与业务插件，支持按领域拆分模块。</li>
                <li><strong>AutoPage</strong>：自动页面和元数据能力，加速后台场景交付。</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="known-site-card known-site-card-accent">
            <h3>宿主层与运行模式</h3>
            <ul class="known-site-list">
                <li><strong>Known.Server</strong>：Blazor Server 模式的运行入口。</li>
                <li><strong>Known.Wasm / Known.WasmHost</strong>：WebAssembly 与混合宿主方案。</li>
                <li><strong>Known.WinForm / Known.Maui / Known.Photino</strong>：桌面与移动端承载能力。</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
